    },
    "atom::ae171e269c1d9e7c85a6cef1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ae171e269c1d9e7c85a6cef1",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用叙事性综述方法，系统回顾并分类整理了关于肠道微生物群与ICI疗效关联的临床观察研究、动物模型实验及早期临床试验。分析路线包括：1) 阐述微生物-宿主免疫互作的基础机制；2) 按细菌门类/科属（如Lachnospiraceae, Ruminococcaceae, Bacteroidetes, Akkermansiaceae等）归纳其在不同癌症类型中对ICI疗效的正向或负向影响；3) 总结基于微生物群的干预手段（FMT、益生菌、饮食调整）的临床转化进展；4) 讨论领域内的不一致性及未来研究方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f883ab3e495ba3b4a0c3d6d0779c5ad31e530be9344114fe554b77f41841993a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2c2b3e3bb643a91e273c7020": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2c2b3e3bb643a91e273c7020",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效的全面机制框架，涵盖了从受体激活、代谢产物（如SCFAs、肌苷）到特定免疫细胞亚群调控的多层次路径。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于已发表研究的汇总，无法控制原始研究的偏倚；对于某些细菌的具体作用机制（如Lachnospiraceae的部分菌株）尚不明确，且临床转化证据多来自小规模试验或动物模型。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a1e6358f5dd205fa9fbe3190c11e58692a33649d98b23f6f8d0aaa0643f13437",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3424f0c3ca4597985c7465ee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3424f0c3ca4597985c7465ee",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "识别了多个潜在的生物标志物候选者（如A. muciniphila, Ruminococcaceae丰度），并评估了FMT和细菌联合体的治疗潜力。",
        "limits": "未能确立标准化的微生物组分析协议，指出当前领域缺乏统一的数据处理标准，限制了跨研究的比较和临床应用的可靠性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a1e6358f5dd205fa9fbe3190c11e58692a33649d98b23f6f8d0aaa0643f13437",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0e3f45191b94d0845d5a0038": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0e3f45191b94d0845d5a0038",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "多种实体瘤（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、HCC等）接受抗PD-1/PD-L1或抗CTLA-4治疗",
        "finding": "特定有益菌群（如Ruminococcaceae, Lachnospiraceae, Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）在响应者中富集，通常与CD8+ T细胞浸润增加、Treg抑制减弱或Th1型免疫反应增强相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
