      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5af05e83c9be77fd6034be534e787e7ddbd5c32ff9118f788cec985d5154fdbc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1c94b0dee0bbe29966cecf69": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1c94b0dee0bbe29966cecf69",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效，但具体是哪些细菌或代谢物起作用、其作用机制是什么、以及如何将这些发现转化为有效的辅助治疗策略，目前仍不完全清楚。综述旨在整合现有证据，阐明微生物驱动的反应机制，并为未来的靶向干预提供方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2965181542ceb9f69455fbf2e48e365ef258260c5d6149e44698edf725567cf3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::839d4b222c751e284ea489d7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::839d4b222c751e284ea489d7",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类肠道微生物群（Gut Microbiota）与宿主免疫系统及癌症免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，如抗PD-1/PD-L1、抗CTLA-4）疗效之间的相互作用；涵盖多种实体瘤（黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肝细胞癌、结直肠癌等）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::26784f33451fb72ed52142bbfc2e6e54f9f89b774d61b460dcd010cb832ca6a2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1fe5b0c46b443999e86c2f08": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1fe5b0c46b443999e86c2f08",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在梳理肠道微生物群如何影响抗肿瘤免疫反应及ICIs的治疗效果。文章首先概述了肠道菌群通过模式识别受体（TLRs/NLRs）和代谢产物调节宿主免疫稳态的机制，随后重点分析了特定细菌类群（如厚壁菌门、拟杆菌门、阿克曼菌属等）在ICI治疗响应者与非响应者中的丰度差异及其潜在的免疫调节机制。此外，综述还评估了基于微生物群的干预策略（如粪菌移植FMT、益生菌、细菌联合体）在增强ICI疗效方面的临床前和临床研究证据，并指出了当前研究在标准化、功能导向及个体差异方面的局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5dca8d9e29d732c182092886c1b07ec27a6c8c5d0b287863996ebc896002d3c9",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::26aaabcaa35afa5914a79cbb588aec6c1d6c2a8a55d65e359bdd6d2bde4c65c9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c6d7d033ddd2a2e677ab8bc6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c6d7d033ddd2a2e677ab8bc6",
      "source_handle": "P0430",
      "field_path": [
