    "atom::6692a76d1f610d5d9cf5ba75": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6692a76d1f610d5d9cf5ba75",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICIs和PPIs在癌症治疗中常联合使用，但两者之间的药物相互作用及其潜在的不良后果尚不清楚。研究试图回答：ICIs与PPIs联用是否会增强特定类型不良反应的发生频率？不同亚型的ICI与PPI联用是否存在差异化的风险模式？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::285c4b40b3238a70218dfa3799880db609e9e1a23634aae9871132bd41e70478",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::205512a5abda225e13ef4a6c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::205512a5abda225e13ef4a6c",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "基于美国FDA不良事件报告系统（FAERS）2014-2023年的真实世界数据，研究免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1、PD-L1、CTLA-4抑制剂）与质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）联合使用时的药物相互作用信号。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::39c88192dd037be5efb7f90dc9cef8a73921dc04bf2e311bc1cbcd414957891e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::52a5725b3c17473da57c0224": {
      "atom_id": "atom::52a5725b3c17473da57c0224",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在评估ICIs与PPIs联用是否会产生特定的药物相互作用（DDI）。作者利用FAERS数据库，通过非比例性分析计算报告比值比（ROR），并采用逻辑回归调整混杂因素（年龄、性别、报告年份），同时结合加法和乘法模型验证信号稳健性。研究识别出四个存在显著交互作用的标准化MedDRA查询系统器官分类（SOC），并进一步按ICI亚型进行了子集分析。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::bf11c5b27328db89668fc4df7fa744d90196eaf4ece684af2b863c31d238dcb0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4b88fa908771d14d61a4324d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4b88fa908771d14d61a4324d",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了ICIs与PPIs联用在真实世界中产生的具体不良反应信号图谱，特别是揭示了PPI可能加剧ICI引起的肝毒性、皮肤毒性及代谢问题的统计学证据。对于综述而言，它提供了关于“PPI作为共病管理药物如何干扰ICI安全性”的实证数据，支持了PPI可能通过改变微环境或药理途径影响ICI疗效/安全性的假设，但需明确其仅为相关性信号而非因果机制证明。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d1d126ca65475c8f4debc97bcbfea8d0906d2465d8b184bca3205cdef492123d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::56b6a2551c1289a1bb4d82d3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::56b6a2551c1289a1bb4d82d3",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是基于自发报告系统的关联性信号，不能直接证明PPI降低了ICI的抗肿瘤疗效，也不能确定具体的生物学机制。样本主要来自老年患者（中位年龄66岁），结果可能受年龄相关共病影响。",
        "contribution": "提供了ICIs与PPIs联用导致特定不良反应增加的流行病学证据。数据显示联用组在肝胆、皮肤、代谢及遗传类疾病上的报告率显著高于单药组，提示PPI的使用可能与ICI相关的毒性增强有关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9378086ba75cf5b1e924dcaa374d3ede309117cc266217bcfafef74536d86235",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3fbe02dd2af77ec6ea959b0b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3fbe02dd2af77ec6ea959b0b",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证PPI作为常见伴随用药，可能在真实世界环境中增加ICI治疗的负担或风险，从而解释部分临床观察到的疗效异质性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a2df2d691e7102cb54493a60781a83220aa8d329c69b1e39b5628d326d671869",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::122f813ead4ccc1ef3aa8b6cb07eb8ad2a40384cf06920d4000712f766e1fbd9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::34b2e27f63ea6bdc24ff032c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::34b2e27f63ea6bdc24ff032c",
      "source_handle": "P0088",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些机制解释是作者基于文献的综合推断，并非本研究的实验结果。研究本身未测量肠道菌群或生物标志物。",
        "contribution": "在讨论部分提出了潜在的机制假说：PPI通过抑制胃酸分泌改变肠道菌群组成（减少多样性、改变特定菌属丰度），进而影响全身免疫反应和ICI介导的毒性。此外，还讨论了药代动力学和药效学相互作用的可能性。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::99dca5ed26b79c0e38d217ef0cfa2774ab4674881e1509b7c919a4061c537c55",
          "field_path": [
