    },
    "atom::f671f6ddd8abcda9cd2e6d01": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f671f6ddd8abcda9cd2e6d01",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "传统药代动力学/药效学（PK/PD）框架无法充分解释伴随用药对ICI疗效的影响；需要理解iDDIs的系统级机制，并探索如何利用AI技术应对iDDIs的高维复杂性、时间动态性和情境依赖性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8270559e632331633d93e606dd066d5e6d6a83a48d26fa55d386cab93775e6b9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::215ea57c1dc100319d207591": {
      "atom_id": "atom::215ea57c1dc100319d207591",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗中的免疫学药物-药物相互作用（iDDIs），涵盖抗生素、质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）、皮质类固醇、阿片类药物、苯二氮卓类药物以及心血管/代谢药物对ICI疗效和安全性的影响，并探讨人工智能（AI）在识别和管理这些相互作用中的应用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::edb36174d84277cd8ccb560c788110d859b4926d4ae0fe821e9e387cba060e4c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c00af64e09f7300589f81052": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c00af64e09f7300589f81052",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在提出“免疫学药物-药物相互作用”（iDDIs）的概念框架，以解释伴随用药如何通过宿主介导的机制（而非传统的药代动力学/药效学途径）调节抗肿瘤免疫。文章系统梳理了三类主要机制：肠道微生物群失调、全身性免疫抑制和肿瘤微环境（TME）调节，并总结了相关药物的临床证据。此外，文章评估了自然语言处理（NLP）、大语言模型（LLM）、机器学习（ML）及可解释AI等技术在提取用药数据、预测结局和支持临床决策方面的潜力与局限。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3b44435594f2e12ff7cf2576fc25569abde7d7083e35f993870e164234b3011f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::389b6b7491aa434335ca108d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::389b6b7491aa434335ca108d",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效提供了详细的机制背景和临床证据汇总，特别是关于抗生素和PPIs的影响。它明确了微生物群介导的iDDIs是核心机制之一，并指出了当前证据的局限性（如混杂因素），这有助于在综述中定位微生物群研究的现状和挑战。同时，它提供的AI技术视角可作为讨论未来研究方向或方法学挑战的背景素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1d23bb9eae410bcec1357987e28592a578a3c79ecd923fd95a7b698dbb993cca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::99c9e618447029c78e528c82": {
      "atom_id": "atom::99c9e618447029c78e528c82",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "证据主要来自观察性研究和荟萃分析，存在“病人用户偏差”和疾病严重程度等混杂因素，不能直接确立因果关系。",
        "contribution": "提供了抗生素和PPIs通过破坏肠道微生物群多样性、减少有益菌（如Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia muciniphila）从而削弱CD8+ T细胞活化和树突状细胞激活的具体机制描述。汇总了多项荟萃分析数据，显示抗生素和PPIs使用与ICI治疗后较差的OS和PFS显著相关，特别是暴露于ICI启动前特定时间窗（30-90天 for antibiotics, baseline/60 days for PPIs）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e974a000dcca012d401f336e9ddecd32d720daa5de0755d8734e081bc525cb50",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::31e8c2c43bb6cbd0da5a90f8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::31e8c2c43bb6cbd0da5a90f8",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效的问题，提供具体的负面效应证据和时间敏感性细节。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3e5995ccfb619f2f9a47e29dbeeee37cb84ca55cf05a279f82080aba7ac5c0e2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::19b743b655c6eeaef9b26ac2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::19b743b655c6eeaef9b26ac2",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述基于预临床研究和部分临床关联，具体因果链条在人类患者中尚未完全证实，且不同肿瘤类型间可能存在差异。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物群介导的iDDIs的分子和细胞机制：包括微生物衍生的生物分子支持抗肿瘤免疫启动、树突状细胞激活、CD4+/CD8+ T细胞效应功能增强。指出抗生素导致菌群失调，PPIs通过升高胃pH值改变菌群组成。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e974a000dcca012d401f336e9ddecd32d720daa5de0755d8734e081bc525cb50",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b45521bd53e90084bdc8df76": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b45521bd53e90084bdc8df76",
      "source_handle": "P0286",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释肠道微生物群调节ICI疗效的具体生物学机制路径。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a191b990962ed40dd3ae9df09476c9d7fcfa71eab67bda617ebf6a9633ab60fa",
          "field_path": [
