    },
    "atom::4052350fa9af034107f9c2a8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4052350fa9af034107f9c2a8",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道细菌可调节免疫检查点阻断（ICB）的治疗反应，但饮食（特别是膳食纤维）和商业益生菌补充剂如何具体影响这一相互作用尚不清楚。本研究试图明确这些饮食相关因素是否以及如何影响免疫治疗的临床结局及其潜在机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cd4bd19193b9b492311379f8d50d16916f9b53fd38c3501cf1dbc484ebc8a2cf",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a7e47ac58f6df5579e7f51d40866b52c4f59b64410497a7e6171a895ca30f0dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c4735cc5a6d86c86aefb7e26": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c4735cc5a6d86c86aefb7e26",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "黑色素瘤患者（观察性队列，n=438，其中128名接受免疫检查点阻断治疗ICB）及平行的小鼠模型；研究情境为评估饮食纤维摄入、益生菌补充剂使用与肠道微生物组特征及对ICB治疗反应的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cd4bd19193b9b492311379f8d50d16916f9b53fd38c3501cf1dbc484ebc8a2cf",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d51df55cb373336103a953c72c4a944fa62fc316f939f601df8e73e1a8c4cda6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6083053a8deeef1c3932b5ca": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6083053a8deeef1c3932b5ca",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在探讨饮食因素（膳食纤维和益生菌）如何通过调节肠道微生物组影响癌症患者的免疫治疗反应。作者通过观察性研究分析了黑色素瘤患者的饮食记录和临床结果，并结合小鼠实验验证了低纤维饮食或益生菌使用对抗PD-1疗法反应的负面影响。研究发现高纤维摄入且不使用益生菌的患者预后更好，机制上涉及肿瘤微环境中干扰素-γ阳性细胞毒性T细胞的频率变化。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cd4bd19193b9b492311379f8d50d16916f9b53fd38c3501cf1dbc484ebc8a2cf",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::21b6dfbde9fdc7bf5e1749f2c3e4c96445b3a3383c5fbfb7060e8d0c20773fab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3bfc77bd982582a91d7e2649": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3bfc77bd982582a91d7e2649",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于饮食干预（纤维和益生菌）如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂疗效的具体实证数据。它连接了宏观饮食行为与微观免疫机制（T细胞浸润），特别指出了益生菌可能具有负面影响的反直觉发现，这对于理解非抗生素类微生物调节因素至关重要。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cd4bd19193b9b492311379f8d50d16916f9b53fd38c3501cf1dbc484ebc8a2cf",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b6a356969b6815c0602b47485eb50f8e20ca84794e35c451a6af2c9e9e5d26f5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7d2dba7c334004fc6514d640": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7d2dba7c334004fc6514d640",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限黑色素瘤队列；观察性设计，存在混杂因素风险；未提供微生物组物种层面的详细变化机制，仅关联临床结局。",
        "contribution": "提供了饮食因素（高纤维、无益生菌）与黑色素瘤患者ICB治疗反应（PFS改善）之间的正相关观察数据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cd4bd19193b9b492311379f8d50d16916f9b53fd38c3501cf1dbc484ebc8a2cf",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ba3e93fa4013679bf176ff1259f3fb9065ae10423a04ab2b03d0253c48d665d7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c98a4d5ba5467999576373bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c98a4d5ba5467999576373bd",
      "source_handle": "P0390",
      "field_path": [
