    "atom::6cb71c2579d02cf88eb5b587": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6cb71c2579d02cf88eb5b587",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用叙事性综述方法。通过系统检索 PubMed、PsycINFO 和 Web of Science 数据库（截至2025年10月），筛选关于肿瘤相关抑郁症、肠道微生物群/菌群失调以及免疫检查点抑制剂/免疫治疗的同行评审英文文献。优先选择人类临床研究和控制良好的预实验。作者并未进行新的荟萃分析或原始实验，而是通过理论整合，构建了一个连接情绪韧性、微生物生态学和免疫调节的综合模型，并梳理了相关的生化通路（如HPA轴、色氨酸代谢）和临床干预手段。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a0e589cca75964984d4dfbfca056553148e774a687b065dff1b540cecfed98fa",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b183a278438ee19494ba0c73": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b183a278438ee19494ba0c73",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提出了一个整合性的“心理-微生物学框架”，将肿瘤相关抑郁症、肠道微生物生态和免疫调节视为相互依赖的统一系统，超越了以往仅关注炎症单一通路的视角。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的统计合并结果或定量效应量。由于是叙事性综述，其结论依赖于作者对文献的选择性解读，可能存在发表偏倚。此外，大多数支持该框架的人类证据为相关性而非因果性，且缺乏针对联合心理-微生物干预的前瞻性随机对照试验验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b200ef48983af0c44c732151d3d189a5701c7e249fdd01f4169f58e790a10cac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::654c364c825def66d0c04829": {
      "atom_id": "atom::654c364c825def66d0c04829",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "明确了区分重度抑郁症（MDD）和亚综合征抑郁症状的重要性，指出两者在生物标志物（细胞因子、HPA轴活性、微生物组成）上可能存在差异。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代用于区分这两类抑郁状态的具体生物标志物阈值或诊断标准的一致性评估。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b200ef48983af0c44c732151d3d189a5701c7e249fdd01f4169f58e790a10cac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a0531383d8377963e3e12d80": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a0531383d8377963e3e12d80",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "梳理了色氨酸-犬尿氨酸途径作为连接炎症、抑郁症状和免疫抑制的关键生化桥梁。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代不同癌症类型中该途径的具体代谢物浓度变化及其对特定免疫检查点（如PD-1 vs CTLA-4）影响的差异性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b200ef48983af0c44c732151d3d189a5701c7e249fdd01f4169f58e790a10cac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d7a999d9db3280d649492937": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d7a999d9db3280d649492937",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "肿瘤患者中伴有显著抑郁症状或重度抑郁症（MDD）",
        "finding": "抑郁症通过激活HPA轴导致皮质醇升高，抑制T细胞增殖和干扰素-γ产生；同时上调IL-6、TNF-α等促炎细胞因子，并通过色氨酸-犬尿氨酸途径减少血清素合成并增加神经毒性代谢物，从而削弱抗肿瘤免疫反应，可能导致PD-1/PD-L1阻断疗法的响应率降低和无进展生存期缩短。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8aed93aedb36c1212e9ad02db2f487dae89ee52e618b107bd6bffa454ae039c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8c94b3847d458150b00ce035": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8c94b3847d458150b00ce035",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "存在肠道微生物群失调（Dysbiosis）或有益菌（如Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium）丰度低",
        "finding": "微生物群失衡与系统性炎症增加、免疫耐受增强（调节性T细胞优势）以及对免疫检查点抑制剂的耐药性相关。相反，高微生物多样性和特定有益菌丰度与更强的免疫治疗响应相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8aed93aedb36c1212e9ad02db2f487dae89ee52e618b107bd6bffa454ae039c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9d2bdd3acf50ae104ee8c2a4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9d2bdd3acf50ae104ee8c2a4",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "应用微生物调节策略（如FMT、益生菌、益生元）",
        "finding": "粪菌移植（FMT）在黑色素瘤等非初始响应者中显示出恢复微生物多样性并提高免疫治疗疗效的潜力。益生菌和益生元可能通过调节细胞因子产生和改善肠道屏障功能来增强免疫反应和情绪调节，但具体联系血清素调节的证据有限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8aed93aedb36c1212e9ad02db2f487dae89ee52e618b107bd6bffa454ae039c1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d98f56ace736dbc659da857e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d98f56ace736dbc659da857e",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::07152560f0ce16c03a279a1e01d80d9bf3ff6231c0f5ed76e44ad585091a0d3c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a6fcb4e11f1f02146725f993": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a6fcb4e11f1f02146725f993",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "现有的免疫检查点抑制剂疗法仅对部分患者有效，且疗效受多种因素影响。目前缺乏将心理因素（特别是肿瘤相关抑郁症）与生物学因素（肠道微生物群）结合的系统性解释。本研究旨在解决如何理解心理 distress 与微生物生态共同调节免疫治疗敏感性的问题，并为开发联合心理和微生物干预以改善预后提供理论依据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0f0a147ad0e01dfde3f40610199dad5f9d467d8b2028068a90429a53543a4c9e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::81ed94ce14664cb24cad295f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::81ed94ce14664cb24cad295f",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肿瘤相关抑郁症（Tumor-associated depression）、肠道微生物群（Gut microbiota）与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效之间的相互作用。涵盖从心理神经免疫学机制到临床干预策略的理论框架，主要基于人类临床研究证据及受控的预实验数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0e431007682a3388ae8620c38016f8068254bef2bc75b18682d7a5c438dfb98e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::35cd035f024ce76b5a5cd280": {
      "atom_id": "atom::35cd035f024ce76b5a5cd280",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇叙事性综述，旨在综合现有证据，阐述肿瘤相关抑郁症、肠道微生物群改变与免疫检查点调节如何在共享的生物框架内相互作用。文章首先区分了重度抑郁症（MDD）和亚综合征抑郁症状，随后详细阐述了抑郁症通过下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺（HPA）轴激活、促炎细胞因子释放以及色氨酸-犬尿氨酸代谢途径改变来削弱抗肿瘤免疫功能的机制。接着，文章引入了“肠-脑-免疫轴”概念，解释肠道微生物如何通过代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）和神经信号介导情绪与免疫的交互。最后，综述提出了一个创新的“心理-微生物学框架”，探讨了益生菌、益生元、合生元及粪菌移植（FMT）等微生物调节策略作为免疫治疗增敏剂的潜力，并讨论了将其整合到个性化癌症护理中的临床意义与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5b64fcf84465f87d3e9b284654660b70784d93f7c2a8fc303b2b8661d04f7a0d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::045215a6056b8df683222b55": {
      "atom_id": "atom::045215a6056b8df683222b55",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物群如何影响实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂疗效提供了重要的背景机制和中介变量视角。它特别强调了心理因素（肿瘤相关抑郁症）作为微生物群改变的驱动因素，进而间接影响免疫治疗结局的作用。虽然不直接提供微生物组直接调控免疫效应的原始实验数据，但它提供了关键的病理生理学连接（如炎症、HPA轴、色氨酸代谢），有助于解释为何某些患者的微生物组特征与较差的免疫治疗预后相关，并为探索心理-微生物联合干预提供了理论支撑。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::725280e89d6a6f79944ecd2c5d132aaf322b0a94ffc86f8c10dd1827dcb19b6f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c36848565722f39fc0407fa2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c36848565722f39fc0407fa2",
      "source_handle": "P0147",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要基于观察性研究和少量预实验，缺乏大规模前瞻性队列的直接因果证据。未提供具体的微生物分类群丰度阈值或标准化检测方法。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群失调与免疫检查点抑制剂疗效降低之间的关联证据，并指出了有益菌（如Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium）丰度与更好疗效的联系。同时指出抗生素使用和抑郁导致的菌群紊乱会间接损害免疫敏感性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::4a75936e13c7ac85238470aece6c80da0a4f3e7abd84360908298d95d6cbd5ab",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ed0cb3db3ca9164210e1e1b33010b82b9cbed3a73357c6047fd8352ac37fae5e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
